WEBVTT

00:05:00.254 --> 00:05:01.505
To my face.

00:05:01.547 --> 00:05:03.341
(Laughter)

00:05:03.382 --> 00:05:09.347
Like any normal person,
I was taken aback by his lack of faith,

00:05:09.388 --> 00:05:11.474
but I didn't let that stop me.

00:05:11.515 --> 00:05:15.936
I felt like I was duty bound
to build the change,

00:05:15.936 --> 00:05:18.522
the innovation that I wanted
to see in the world.

00:05:19.231 --> 00:05:20.733
And although he was right,

00:05:20.733 --> 00:05:22.735
I don’t look like the classic hero.

00:05:23.486 --> 00:05:26.864
But, like Frodo, the journey chose me.

00:05:26.864 --> 00:05:28.783
(Laughter)

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:34.080
(Applause)